<title>USA: Harleysville Group Inc Q1 oper shr rises.</title>
<headline>Harleysville Group Inc Q1 oper shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>HARLEYSVILLE, Pa. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		 1996</p>
<p> Premiums earned		     $156,381		$148,019</p>
<p>Investment income, net</p>
<p>  of investment expenses	     20,591		  19,232</p>
<p> Net income				10,832		     873</p>
<p>   Net EPS				   0.76		    0.06</p>
<p>   Cash dividend			   0.21		    0.19</p>
<p> Wgtd avg outstanding	    14,191,136	    13,763,239</p>
<p>	   (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 operating profit $0.74/shr vs loss $0.04. Last year the &quot;Blizzard of '96&quot; and other severe winter weather reduced Q1 operating earnings by $9.7 million, or $0.71 a share, after pooling and taxes.</p>
<p>Q1 after-tax realized investment gains $0.02/shr vs $0.10.</p>
